---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact & Free Quote
description: Free, no-obligation artificial turf quote. Response within 2 hours. Same-day site visits available across Gauteng. Call or WhatsApp Leon on 076 804 8868.
breadcrumbs:
  - label: Contact
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap quote">
    <div class="quote__intro">
      <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Contact</span></li></ol></nav>
      <p class="eyebrow">Free quote</p>
      <h1 class="display-l">Talk to {{ site.contact.person }}.</h1>
      <p class="lede">{{ site.promises.quote }}. {{ site.promises.response }}. {{ site.promises.siteVisit }}.</p>
      <ul class="contact-cards">
        <li><a class="contact-card" href="tel:{{ site.contact.phoneE164 }}"><span class="mono">Call</span><strong>{{ site.contact.phoneDisplay }}</strong></a></li>
        <li><a class="contact-card" href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="mono">WhatsApp</span><strong>{{ site.contact.phoneDisplay }}</strong></a></li>
        <li><a class="contact-card" href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}"><span class="mono">Email</span><strong>{{ site.contact.email }}</strong></a></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="warranty-note">
        <p class="mono">Warranty</p>
        <p>{{ site.warranty.statement }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="quote__form">
      {% include "partials/quote-form.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
